    <node id="Paper_3425">
      <data key="d0">Paper</data>
      <data key="d1">VAST</data>
      <data key="d2">2011</data>
      <data key="d3">Analyst's workspace: Protecting vastopolis</data>
      <data key="d4">10.1109/vast.2011.6102495</data>
      <data key="d5">http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/VAST.2011.6102495</data>
      <data key="d6">323.0</data>
      <data key="d7">324.0</data>
      <data key="d8">M</data>
      <data key="d9">Analyst's Workspace is a sensemaking environment designed specifically for use of large, high-resolution displays. It employs a spatial workspace to integrate foraging and synthesis activities into a unified process. In this paper we describe how Analyst's Workspace solved the VAST 2011 mini-challenge #3 and discuss some of the unique features of the environment.</data>
      <data key="d10">Christopher Andrews 0001;Mahmud Shahriar Hossain;Samah Gad;Naren Ramakrishnan;Chris North 0001</data>
      <data key="d11">Christopher Andrews;M. Shahriar Hossain;Samah Gad;Naren Ramakrishnan;Chris North</data>
      <data key="d12">Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, USA;Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, USA;Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, USA;Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, USA;Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, USA</data>
